            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#df3534' fontsize='20'>Disclaimers and Notes for the dashboard</run>
              <run>
Note:- Many metrics will be not present or 0% in the dashboard due to the prevalent front-end tracking issues. 

</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff2600' fontsize='12'>Media Asset Overview tab</run>
              <run>
- The Banner CTR and ATC data for Local Shops (between Week 1 and Week 9) is not tracked properly.

-The Swimlane data is not present because the swimlane visit sessions are not being tracked properly, although the swimlane ATC sessions are being calculated. Hence, to avoid confusion and discrepancy in the numbers, it was better thought to leave them aside.

</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ff2600' fontsize='12'>Media Asset Performance:-</run>
              <run>
The difference between the Media Asset Overview and the Media Asset Performance is the deep-dive on the specific Media-Asset and their details (for e.g:- the session level on a specific category, banner, swimlane or search term)
</run>
